  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="transcription" xml:id="transcription_aad_0178" xml:lang="en">
          <div type="letter">
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00532/" ed="1r" type="sheet"/>
            <div type="letter_message" hand="#type_black_hoggart">
              <opener>
                <seg hand="#print_cccs">
                  <orgName>
                    <lb/><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_443">School of English,
                    <lb/>The University,</rs></orgName> <rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_269">Birmingham</rs>, 15
                    <lb/>Telephone : Selly Oak 1301 
                </seg>
                <seg hand="#print_cccs">
                  <orgName>
                    <lb/><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_445">Centre for Contemporary Cultural Studies</rs>
                  </orgName>
                    <lb/>Director : <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_708">Professor Richard Hoggart</rs>
                  <lb/>Research Fellow : <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_709">Stuart Hall</rs>
                </seg>
                <seg>
                  <lb/>RH/FAR<space quantity="51" unit="char"/><date>25th May, l967</date>
                </seg>
                <seg>
                  <persName>
                    <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">W. H. Auden</rs>,
                  </persName>
                  <placeName>
                    <address>
                      <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_2">Kirchstetten (<foreign xml:lang="de">Westbahn</foreign>),
                      <lb/>Hinterholz 6,</rs>
                      <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_6"><foreign xml:lang="de">N.-<g ref="#uml_o_uc_tt">Ö</g>.</foreign>, Austria.</rs>
                    </address>
                  </placeName>
                </seg>
                <salute hand="#hand_black_hoggart">
                  <lb/>Dear <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">Wystan</rs>
                </salute>
              </opener>
              <p>
                <lb/>Thanks very much for your note from <rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_5">Kirchstetten</rs>.<space quantity="2" unit="char"/>No, I've never
                <lb/>received your original letter.<space quantity="2" unit="char"/>However, that doesn't matter now and 
                <lb/>we are delighted that you will stay with us.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/>Perhaps some time nearer the <rs type="event" ref="#amp_event_id_448">date</rs> you would let me know just when
                <lb/>you will be arriving and I will meet you off the train or plane.<space quantity="2" unit="char"/>I 
                <lb/>don't know what sort of time the <rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_444">University</rs> will leave you for more
                <lb/>unofficial social affairs but if there's anybody you'd particularly
                <lb/>like to renew acquaintance with - or meet for the first time - will you
                <lb/>let me know and I'll do my best to fix it.
              </p>
              <closer hand="#hand_black_hoggart">
                <salute>
                  <lb/>Best wishes
                </salute >
                <signed>
                  <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_708">Richard</rs>
                </signed>
              </closer>
            </div>
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00533/" ed="1v" type="sheet"/>
            <div>
              <ab hand="#hand_blue_unident_0178">
                <lb/>38
              </ab>
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
